ca23a4b7cafab4d2fdffc0b94d","message":"Exclude transient Kotlin sessions from native runtime fingerprints (#480)\n\nThe first integrated release built the signed phone/Wear binaries but\nstopped before publication because the phone runtime differed from the\npost-build source fingerprint. The locked Expo SDK hashes Kotlin daemon\n`.kotlin` session/cache files inside native Gradle plugin directories;\nthese are temporary build state, not native source.\n\nExclude that generated directory while preserving native/plugin/Gradle\nsource hashing. Reuse one embedded-runtime verifier for release APK/AAB\nchecks and add an Android package CI regression that compares clean\nsource, built APK, and post-build source fingerprints. Mismatches now\nreport both hashes.\n\nValidation: release tests (184 passed, 2 skipped), native-release tests\n(237 passed), SDK hasher regression proving session files otherwise\nchange the hash while actual Kotlin source changes remain detected, and\n`git diff --check`. Hosted Android package CI must pass before rollout.\n\nRollout: release record 411130261 was explicitly abandoned by protected\nrecovery run 38335912171, preserving server 0.40.2 deployment/health and\nreserved codes 15/16. No client submission or OTA occurred. After this\ncorrection passes CI, run Cut release with the next available native\npair. No environment, credential, WireGuard, or homelab configuration\nchanges are required.","timestamp":"2026-10-13T02:45:27Z","author":{"name":"Matthew Chartier","email":"MChartier@gmail.com"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1102078034,"node_id":"R_kgDOQbBgUg","name":"calibrate-health","full_name":"MChartier/calibrate-health","private":false,"owner":{"login":"MChartier","id":1258197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTgxOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1258197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MChartier","html_url":"https://github.com/MChartier","followers_u